				(thickness 0.12)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "JLC08161H-3313: 3313 0.0994 / core 0.100 / 3x2116 0.3568 / core 0.300 mm; symmetric.\nSelect this stack explicitly. Minimum trace 0.102 mm; clearance 0.127 mm. Through vias only.\n50-ohm RF: 0.18 mm outer. 90-ohm USB: 0.125 mm width / 0.225 mm gap on L6.\nConfirm impedance geometry and tolerance with the fabricator."
		(at 100 156 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "e567dc0d-0952-429a-9082-65c46e5b72af")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "GNSS REVIEW: BSP, GEN and SHPHLD retain short B.Cu paths under U1. Preserve L7 ground.\nQualify GNSS with display refresh, buzzer PWM and power-state changes in the final enclosure."
